# Language Detection Overrides
# Treat README and other docs as documentation so they don't count toward stats
*.md linguist-documentation
*.txt linguist-documentation

# Alternatively, explicitly tell GitHub to ignore HTML and TeX detection
*.html linguist-detectable=false
*.tex linguist-detectable=false

# If you want to be extra sure, force the repo to prioritize Python
*.py linguist-detectable=true